WEBVTT

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:06.038
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.068 --> 00:00:12.408
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.058 --> 00:00:29.318
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.058 --> 00:00:34.688
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:41.198
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.738 --> 00:00:46.938
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.348 --> 00:00:50.868
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.948 --> 00:00:56.048
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.688 --> 00:01:01.178
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.758 --> 00:01:08.718
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.798 --> 00:01:14.708
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.768 --> 00:01:21.338
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.608 --> 00:01:27.478
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:48.168 --> 00:01:50.038
Do you know Tri-Edge?

00:01:50.278 --> 00:01:51.238
Huh?

00:01:57.618 --> 00:01:59.678
I'm only going to ask
one more time.

00:02:00.248 --> 00:02:02.118
Do you know Tri-Edge?

00:02:03.688 --> 00:02:05.888
We don't. Right?

00:02:06.188 --> 00:02:07.158
Yeah.

00:02:30.718 --> 00:02:34.878
Isn't it pointless
coming here everyday?

00:02:35.048 --> 00:02:38.318
I'll decide whether it's
pointless or not.

00:02:38.488 --> 00:02:39.458
Right?

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:42.118
Do whatever you like.

00:02:45.328 --> 00:02:46.418
You know what?

00:02:46.498 --> 00:02:48.398
- Hey!
- Huh?

00:02:49.738 --> 00:02:50.758
Hello.

00:02:51.268 --> 00:02:52.238
Hi!

00:02:52.308 --> 00:02:54.138
T-Tri-Edge!

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:55.398
What about him?

00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:57.768
I heard he's gone!

00:02:58.308 --> 00:02:59.278
Gone?

00:02:59.848 --> 00:03:01.808
People are saying
he disappeared.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:04.778
Uh, are you a beginner?

00:03:05.078 --> 00:03:06.348
Something like that.

00:03:06.788 --> 00:03:09.648
I've heard the rumors
about him though.

00:03:09.888 --> 00:03:11.878
Well, what do you think?

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:15.658
Do you think his account
got suspended?

00:03:16.698 --> 00:03:20.098
That's if he had an account
to begin with.

00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:23.128
Disappeared, huh?

00:03:24.268 --> 00:03:25.568
Are you leaving?

00:03:26.468 --> 00:03:28.458
I just remembered
there's something I have to do.

00:03:28.538 --> 00:03:31.338
- I'll come back.
- You don't have to.

00:03:40.448 --> 00:03:42.938
I wonder what Shino
would do...

00:03:43.018 --> 00:03:44.348
...at a time like this?

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:58.268
There's no doubt he
has the Factor.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:03.238
I wonder how we evoke
the dormant Factor.

00:04:03.808 --> 00:04:06.868
What about jolting him?

00:04:07.048 --> 00:04:08.378
Jolting him?

00:04:08.508 --> 00:04:09.538
Yes.

00:04:10.848 --> 00:04:13.178
When I was awakened...

00:04:14.588 --> 00:04:19.118
...an unimaginable truth
was suddenly thrust upon me.

00:04:24.658 --> 00:04:26.258
I didn't want to believe it.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.428
I didn't want to accept it.

00:04:32.468 --> 00:04:33.438
Then...

00:04:34.038 --> 00:04:37.268
Something pushed me over
the edge and overwhelmed me.

00:04:38.608 --> 00:04:41.008
It was a rush of emotion
that I couldn't control.

00:04:41.778 --> 00:04:44.678
Reason screamed at me
to control myself.

00:04:46.048 --> 00:04:47.918
I can't explain it very well.

00:04:48.248 --> 00:04:50.218
Sometime during that struggle...

00:04:50.288 --> 00:04:54.058
...the real me and Pi,
from the game...

00:04:54.128 --> 00:04:55.858
...synchronized and were linked.

00:05:04.768 --> 00:05:08.398
Haseo is very unstable
right now.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.338
All it'll take
is jolting him a little.

00:05:12.448 --> 00:05:13.938
I'll leave it to you.

00:05:14.308 --> 00:05:15.608
Understood.

00:05:20.348 --> 00:05:23.748
Now, I wonder if it will go
as she plans.

00:05:36.798 --> 00:05:38.458
I said we don't know!

00:05:38.908 --> 00:05:40.628
I don't care if you lose it...

00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:42.678
...but don't be
messing with us.

00:05:43.638 --> 00:05:46.268
Then tell me who might know.

00:05:46.608 --> 00:05:49.668
Anyway, isn't it just an
urban legend?

00:05:50.048 --> 00:05:51.308
That's right.

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:55.148
It's impossible that players killed
by him will lose consciousness.

00:05:56.788 --> 00:05:59.988
You're an idiot
for believing that!

00:06:17.278 --> 00:06:18.368
Is that...?

00:06:18.438 --> 00:06:19.308
What?

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:20.778
Who is that player?

00:06:20.848 --> 00:06:22.108
Oh, him.

00:06:22.818 --> 00:06:24.718
It's better to stay away
from him.

00:06:25.318 --> 00:06:26.288
Let's go.

00:06:35.088 --> 00:06:40.288
There's a rumor going around
that Haseo's lost it.

00:06:40.928 --> 00:06:42.628
Rumors are rumors.

00:06:43.338 --> 00:06:44.888
Yeah, but...

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:51.568
If you and I don't believe
in Haseo, who will?

00:06:53.648 --> 00:06:55.878
Do you believe in Haseo?

00:06:56.748 --> 00:06:58.808
Well, I wonder.

00:07:00.188 --> 00:07:01.948
What does that mean?

00:07:03.088 --> 00:07:07.858
If you try to force
a clam open...

00:07:08.158 --> 00:07:11.388
...the clam will shut itself
even tighter.

00:07:13.898 --> 00:07:16.888
And if you still try to
force it open...

00:07:16.968 --> 00:07:19.198
...the clam will break.

00:07:20.408 --> 00:07:21.428
But...

00:07:21.508 --> 00:07:22.468
Huh?

00:07:23.438 --> 00:07:25.268
Haseo's not a clam.

00:07:26.148 --> 00:07:28.198
A clam doesn't
understand words.

00:07:28.308 --> 00:07:30.178
But Haseo...

00:07:32.548 --> 00:07:35.848
I guess if he doesn't want to listen,
it's the same thing.

00:07:37.358 --> 00:07:41.088
If you don't start talking,
nothing will begin.

00:07:45.198 --> 00:07:46.428
I see.

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:47.928
I get it now.

00:07:49.638 --> 00:07:51.298
I'm going to go see Haseo.

00:07:56.938 --> 00:07:57.928
Anything?

00:07:58.008 --> 00:07:59.568
Absolutely nothing.

00:07:59.648 --> 00:08:02.438
Our network's too thin to give us
reliable information.

00:08:02.818 --> 00:08:03.978
I see.

00:08:04.178 --> 00:08:06.378
If we're talking about rumors...

00:08:06.448 --> 00:08:08.108
...there are lots of those.

00:08:09.018 --> 00:08:11.918
Oh, come to think of it,
I heard a weird rumor.

00:08:13.088 --> 00:08:16.718
Someone saw a player fighting
Tri-Edge in a Lost Ground.

00:08:17.828 --> 00:08:19.418
And he defeated him.

00:08:19.698 --> 00:08:20.998
Defeated Tri-Edge?

00:08:21.298 --> 00:08:22.198
Seriously?

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:24.238
Well, it is only a rumor.

00:08:27.168 --> 00:08:30.008
It'll be easier if you use
TaN's network.

00:08:30.108 --> 00:08:31.128
I can't.

00:08:32.308 --> 00:08:34.748
Should we follow this lead?

00:08:35.648 --> 00:08:37.208
I guess.

00:08:37.278 --> 00:08:41.648
If we can identify the PC
who saw it, then maybe...

00:08:42.218 --> 00:08:43.188
Roger!

00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:00.028
Haseo!

00:09:05.478 --> 00:09:08.038
Uh, you look well!

00:09:10.118 --> 00:09:11.578
Before you transport...

00:09:13.618 --> 00:09:14.588
What?

00:09:14.818 --> 00:09:15.788
Here.

00:09:15.858 --> 00:09:17.188
I won't use it.

00:09:17.788 --> 00:09:18.808
Oh, yeah.

00:09:18.888 --> 00:09:20.718
You got stronger.

00:09:24.558 --> 00:09:26.998
You're so annoying.

00:09:33.108 --> 00:09:37.238
I know it's not so easy.

00:09:49.988 --> 00:09:51.478
I don't need this.

00:09:52.188 --> 00:09:54.018
I didn't think you'd come.

00:09:56.228 --> 00:09:59.428
I wanted to see how you'd look
when you're remorseful.

00:09:59.898 --> 00:10:00.988
You know what?

00:10:01.068 --> 00:10:02.858
So, what is it?

00:10:03.538 --> 00:10:08.128
I'm taking over
surveillance of Haseo.

00:10:08.508 --> 00:10:09.468
I see.

00:10:10.278 --> 00:10:12.208
Tabby is of no interest anymore.

00:10:12.508 --> 00:10:14.668
We know it's not her.

00:10:14.748 --> 00:10:18.948
There's something special
about those two, right?

00:10:19.448 --> 00:10:21.608
I don't need to tell you.

00:10:22.118 --> 00:10:24.748
Besides, you don't seem
interested in helping anymore.

00:10:25.888 --> 00:10:28.688
And I'm going to use
that PC body...

00:10:28.758 --> 00:10:31.418
...so I want you to give it back.

00:10:31.758 --> 00:10:32.728
Use it?

00:10:34.098 --> 00:10:38.538
There's something I want
to try on Haseo with that PC.

00:10:40.138 --> 00:10:41.128
Try on him?

00:10:41.968 --> 00:10:46.668
Is this PC the litmus paper
that will test out Haseo?

00:10:47.078 --> 00:10:48.048
Huh?

00:10:48.548 --> 00:10:51.278
I don't know what you're
planning on using this for...

00:10:51.918 --> 00:10:53.938
...but I won't give it back
right away.

00:10:54.448 --> 00:10:56.578
I've done a lot for you.

00:10:56.658 --> 00:10:58.848
You've got to recognize that.

00:11:02.558 --> 00:11:04.048
You have one week.

00:11:04.728 --> 00:11:06.318
I won't wait any longer.

00:11:11.538 --> 00:11:13.228
Going to try something?

00:11:13.538 --> 00:11:14.628
What could it be?

00:11:28.088 --> 00:11:30.018
I just get in his way...

00:11:30.088 --> 00:11:32.218
...and he won't accept anything I offer.

00:11:32.288 --> 00:11:36.818
I wish there was
something I could do.

00:11:37.928 --> 00:11:40.658
How can he be like that?

00:11:41.498 --> 00:11:44.088
Considering how worried you are
about him...

00:11:44.938 --> 00:11:46.458
Well, he is my friend.

00:11:46.908 --> 00:11:50.428
I don't want to see him
get worse.

00:11:54.008 --> 00:11:59.708
I don't think Shino
would want that either.

00:12:08.388 --> 00:12:11.258
Something that can be
tested in this world.

00:12:12.128 --> 00:12:14.688
What are they trying to do?

00:12:23.538 --> 00:12:26.068
I thought you quit.

00:12:26.148 --> 00:12:27.108
Who says?

00:12:27.178 --> 00:12:28.148
Well...

00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:32.548
That's okay because
I'm quitting.

00:12:33.048 --> 00:12:34.378
Makes no difference.

00:12:34.448 --> 00:12:35.888
I'm wasting time.

00:12:36.018 --> 00:12:39.178
If you're quitting then
leave me alone and get going.

00:12:43.898 --> 00:12:46.488
It looks like things
will get interesting.

00:12:46.998 --> 00:12:48.088
Switch on!

00:12:53.668 --> 00:12:55.198
They're going to try something.

00:12:55.978 --> 00:12:56.938
Huh?

00:13:02.818 --> 00:13:05.778
It's probably something like this.

00:13:12.058 --> 00:13:14.288
Something that can be tested
in this world.

00:13:14.358 --> 00:13:17.058
Something they'd like
to try on Haseo.

00:13:18.358 --> 00:13:21.798
I bet you they want to measure
his newfound strength.

00:13:25.868 --> 00:13:27.858
Would you like to exchange
some information?

00:13:28.238 --> 00:13:30.438
I'm not an informant.

00:13:32.278 --> 00:13:34.638
Well, it doesn't really matter.

00:13:36.648 --> 00:13:40.448
There's another player
who fought Tri-Edge.

00:13:43.858 --> 00:13:47.488
So, how did you survive?

00:13:59.668 --> 00:14:00.868
It's been awhile!

00:14:01.738 --> 00:14:03.798
You've changed too much.

00:14:04.178 --> 00:14:05.068
What is that?

00:14:05.138 --> 00:14:07.478
That's the reward
for clearing the event?

00:14:09.648 --> 00:14:12.118
What do you know
about Tri-Edge?

00:14:12.648 --> 00:14:14.138
Hey, no need to rush.

00:14:14.588 --> 00:14:18.958
Aren't you glad you had
my member address?

00:14:20.288 --> 00:14:21.378
I don't have time.

00:14:21.928 --> 00:14:25.588
Being too hasty won't bring back
the Lost Ones.

00:14:26.628 --> 00:14:28.068
Just tell me.

00:14:28.968 --> 00:14:32.558
So, this is what
desperation is like.

00:14:32.908 --> 00:14:34.368
I'm not kidding around!

00:14:35.408 --> 00:14:37.528
It's only a game.

00:14:44.648 --> 00:14:46.308
It's not.

00:14:59.228 --> 00:15:01.288
I hope it goes well.

00:15:02.168 --> 00:15:06.098
You gave her the bait because
you thought it would go well, right?

00:15:06.938 --> 00:15:10.028
It seems she's just teasing him
and it won't amount to anything.

00:15:10.238 --> 00:15:11.898
That's very unlike you.

00:15:12.808 --> 00:15:13.778
I'm sorry.

00:15:19.218 --> 00:15:20.448
Tell me now.

00:15:21.488 --> 00:15:22.778
You sure have changed.

00:15:23.358 --> 00:15:26.648
You used to
be much straighter.

00:15:27.288 --> 00:15:30.258
I'm still straight.

00:15:30.828 --> 00:15:34.858
No, you've done a complete 360.

00:15:35.398 --> 00:15:38.888
You think you're straight,
but you're actually twisted.

00:15:43.378 --> 00:15:46.068
I don't want anybody else
to have you!

00:15:49.518 --> 00:15:50.568
You really want to do this?

00:15:50.648 --> 00:15:52.208
You want information, right?

00:15:53.748 --> 00:15:56.348
You better not regret it.

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:06.818
Why?

00:16:07.228 --> 00:16:08.698
It's for you.

00:16:10.598 --> 00:16:13.398
Leave the favorite treat
for last.

00:16:13.738 --> 00:16:15.138
Kind of like that.

00:16:34.528 --> 00:16:38.258
I can see how you've stood up
against so many PKs.

00:16:41.768 --> 00:16:47.208
Show me what it is
that no one else has.

00:16:59.278 --> 00:17:00.748
Is that all?

00:17:09.288 --> 00:17:13.858
I guess he
needs a stronger jolting.

00:17:15.368 --> 00:17:16.888
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.168 --> 00:17:19.298
That's okay.

00:17:19.368 --> 00:17:23.358
I guess regular players
are no match for him.

00:17:23.578 --> 00:17:24.968
That's all.

00:17:26.378 --> 00:17:31.908
We should try matching him
with that mysterious phenomena.

00:17:33.988 --> 00:17:37.048
But I don't think
that's necessary yet.

00:17:38.318 --> 00:17:39.788
It's too risky.

00:17:40.858 --> 00:17:43.888
If his PC body
disappears again...

00:17:43.958 --> 00:17:46.558
...it'll be quite a hassle
to find it.

00:17:57.278 --> 00:17:59.678
He has many enemies now.

00:18:00.408 --> 00:18:02.238
Are you talking about Haseo?

00:18:02.778 --> 00:18:07.718
All I think about is Haseo.

00:18:08.748 --> 00:18:11.448
He should give up soon.

00:18:13.688 --> 00:18:16.058
So that's your true feeling, isn't it?

00:18:16.428 --> 00:18:20.058
I don't recall ever disguising
my feelings.

